{"id":"hpcy6jo1gsrwtfjn94woko59l","title":"科学火星人利奥·西拉德：科学家中的另类","originalTitle":null,"summary":"利奥·西拉德在二十世纪物理学革命中扮演了重要角色，他关于核链式反应的顿悟开启了人类利用核能的可能性。1939年，他与爱因斯坦联名致信罗斯福，推动了美国核武器研究的启动。西拉德一生致力于科学与道德的平衡，晚年倡导核军备控制，成为美国最早关注军备控制的科学家之一。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3404169&do=blog&id=1560924"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T08:53:02.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T14:38:14.542Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T14:38:14.542Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表","人物变动"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}